1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Yes, I did.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,940
I was sitting on the floor with my feet on the seat and then I grabbed my leg and cut it off.

3
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,920
Here in the canteen?

4
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:14,680
Did you help them?

5
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,520
We helped them.

6
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:21,220
And there are many dogs like that?

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,960
There are many dogs.

8
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:33,740
When someone comes from outside and eats non-veg, he smells it and the whole thing gets dirty.

9
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,740
The whole thing gets dirty.

10
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:43,140
He also eats the milk he has been given and makes it dirty.

11
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,320
Does it get dirty?

12
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,620
Yes, it does not get dirty.

13
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:51,740
What should you do about it?

14
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,720
Do you have any advice for this?

15
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:06,240
They help us a lot.

16
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:08,920
If they know about us, they don't feed us.

17
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,580
They feed the strangers.

18
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:13,600
So it should be like that.

19
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:20,360
People love you a lot.

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,380
You must have fed them.

21
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:25,860
They must be roaming around here in canteen.

22
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:29,140
Have you ever had any personal problems?

23
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:31,600
No, I haven't.

24
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:34,520
Thank you.

